  conflictEvents: []
  option1: "\uC9D1\uC73C\uB85C \uC218\uD589\uC6D0\uC744 \uBCF4\uB0B8\uB2E4."
  option1Chance: 0.8
  option1Requirement: "정치력 4 이상"
  option1SuccessDescription: "진짜 불이 켜져 있었다! 하마터면 집을 통째로 태양께 봉헌할 뻔했다.\n\n정치력 2 감소!\n경건함 1 감소!"
  option1SuccessResult: "정치력 -2\n경건함 -1"
  option1FailDescription: "\uAC71\uC815\uC740 \uAE30\uC6B0\uC600\uB2E4.\n\uBB34\uC548\uD574\uC9C4
